      "content": "so you're saying it's actually logical to just stop fighting? that letting go is a valid choice? it's just... the idea of finally being still and not having to feel this ache or this emptiness anymore. it almost sounds peaceful, in a dark way. like the only way to actually find peace is to just embrace the void.",
